# The Laravel API is not deployed here.
#
# It lives on the Hostinger VPS and is reached over HTTPS via CRM_API_URL, so
# Vercel only ever needs the Next.js app. Uploading it anyway pushed the deploy
# over Vercel's 15,000-file limit on its own — `backend/vendor` alone is more
# than 16,000 files of Composer packages — and every one of them was upload
# time spent on code this platform does not run.
backend

# Local-only: the artisan dev database, and the link to the old Vercel team.
*.sqlite
.vercel-old-hajz-team
